-Very tweety.

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:30.300
-Yeah. You can vote for
all of them

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.634
or you can vote for
none of them.

00:00:31.634 --> 00:00:33.767
Whatever you want to do,
I just want you to have fun.

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:35.100
We're going to
see the results live.

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:37.234
We have a very
expensive polling system...

00:00:37.234 --> 00:00:38.367
-Ooh!

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:39.501
-...that we spent
millions of dollars.

00:00:39.501 --> 00:00:40.634
-Really?
-Yeah.

00:00:40.634 --> 00:00:42.067
We won the Mega Millions
last week...

00:00:42.067 --> 00:00:43.367
