polling system.

00:00:49.601 --> 00:00:52.267
You press green if you like it,
red if you don't love it.

00:00:52.267 --> 00:00:53.300
Higgins, Roots,
you all have clickers?

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:54.367
-Ready.
-Alright.

00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:55.801
